+#!/bin/sh
+set -eu
+
+# Isolate controlled follower lags (P2P gates or restarts), leader SIGKILLs and leader slow-fsync
+# from unrelated platform/container faults. The command owns cleanup; terminal commands also
+# release gates, holds and slow-fsync after cancellation.
